        {
          "text": "nokhumalila OMWAMI emisango emisambe chiosi, khutsisabato, nokhukhuchaaka khwemiesi, nokhunduukho tsiamasabo, obunji bwachio shinga olwa bulachilisibwa khuchio, imbeli wOMWAMI tsindaalo tsiosi; ",
